{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_wyvern_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_wyvern_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "源石虫与啤酒花",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_wyvern_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c85f3124018d8a38a89302a6ee8c90e89e332bc4bf68d5c0109fb61e1e598b15",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "7:40 A.M. 天气/多云\n卡西米尔某村庄郊外"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "话说，香草小姐，我有一个问题想问很久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你平时都喂大黑吃什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大黑是不挑食的，平时只要喂他一点点蔬菜或者肉，他就很开心啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要一直喂它，它就会长大吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然啦，我最开始养大黑的时候，他只有巴掌这么大，现在已经有这么——唔，下次查德先生可以来亲自看看，大黑很可爱的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我听说，普罗旺斯和天火小姐她们在汐斯塔出任务的时候，遇到了一只超大的源石虫——有一座小山丘那么大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像是吃那边一种叫......黑曜石的石头长大的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "生长在不同环境的源石虫在体形上确实会有不小差异，不过像小山那么大还是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果喂大黑吃黑曜石的话，它是不是也能长到那么大？骑着它上战场岂不是很威风？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "查德先生——绝对不许这么做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（呃，香草小姐......眼神一下子就凶起来了！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，好像到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_county_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看看，地图方向没有错，村子的名字......垒石村，嗯，也没错，就是这儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么回事，看上去就是普通的村庄啊，别说变异源石虫了，我们一路过来连一只普通源石虫都没有见到吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过很多哥伦比亚的怪物电影似乎都是这种开头......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（电影......是那种在一块屏幕里会动的画面吗？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......源石虫作为一种常见生物，我们过来时一只都没有见到，是不是也有些反常？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下来怎么办？我们先在附近转转，还是等接头的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......等一下，你有没有闻到，有一种很香的味道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很熟悉......这个味道是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啤酒花的味道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想起来了！任务手册里提到了，这座村子是以啤酒制造为主要产业的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这种情况，可以带点土特产回去的吧？凯尔希医生不会有意见的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个，查德先生，请先集中注意力在任务上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出发前杜宾教官多次强调过，这次任务是非常重要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看看这几份报告。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是......源石虫袭击致人重伤，还有冲入村庄毁坏农田？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛最近收治了几个从附近医院转移来的伤员，都是来自同一个村庄，受伤原因统一为被源石虫袭击。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除了救治伤员，村民希望我们可以帮助他们解决源石虫的问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "医院担心他们会感染矿石病，将他们送来罗德岛。好在这几人只是受伤，并没有感染。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......如果没有术师操控，野生源石虫一般不会袭击人类，更不用说闯入人类居住的村落了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "发生这种事情，一定是有什么特殊的原因才对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "据村民说，袭击村庄的，是非常巨大的变异源石虫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "变异？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更具体的情报我们暂且不得而知。但那里的村民在孤立无援的情况下向我们求助，我们不应该坐视不管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我想让你去调查这件事。当然，我也会让其他干员来协助你，但是任务中具体判断还是要全权交给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，杜宾教官，您真的要让我来负责源石虫相关的任务......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听好了香草，这并不是对你的考验，而是切实需要你的知识与能力去解决的严重问题。绝不能抱有侥幸心理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我相信你可以妥善处理的，香草干员。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是......是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_county_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（没想到我也要像雷蛇前辈芙兰卡前辈一样，负责一整个任务了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（杜宾教官如此相信我，我绝对不能让她失望！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（如果没能好好完成任务的话一定会被扣光工资，大黑也要一起饿肚子了！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以查德先生也要严肃对待，在任务完成前绝对不可以分心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明......明白了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（怎么突然这么严肃！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请问，二位就是罗德岛的工作人员吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好！您是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是这里的村长，就是我联系的罗德岛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，你们可算来啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，难道我们已经来晚了？可我看这附近好像也没什么——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟我来吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_outcounty"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您是说......这一大片种植园，全是被源石虫弄坏的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大概一个月前，有天晚上，有村民听到种植园传来呼救声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家赶了过来，看到当晚负责护林的人倒在地上，浑身是伤，已经奄奄一息了。园子也已经变成了这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "过了整整三天那个人才醒过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "据他所说，那天晚上，他听到园子里有动静，他本来以为是小偷，可靠近一看，是十几只源石虫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请等一下，在夜晚，真的能在这么茂密的树林里看清源石虫的数量吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可那个人说，其中小的也有一人多高，大的有一小栋屋子那么大......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶......听起来也实在太像怪兽恐怖电影了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "话说，有没有可能是那人看错了，他看见的其实是某种别的野兽？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从这些咬痕来看的话，的确是远远超过一般源石虫的大小了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "香草......你见过这么大的源石虫吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（摇头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，一开始大家都不相信，有年轻村民自告奋勇组成了搜查队，去村子后山的树林调查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家又找了好久，这次终于是看清了，确实是大得离谱的源石虫......搜查队也受到了袭击，好几人都受了重伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之后大家就不敢随意出村了，但源石虫还是会闯进村里，攻击村民的情况也时有发生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们也试过向城市求援，但贵族老爷哪会管我们这种小村子......在送伤员去罗德岛的时候，我们才知道有这样的公司。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......多谢你们啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "村长先生您放心，我们一定会尽全力解决村子的问题的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请问，在这之前有在村子里发现过源石虫吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒也不是完全没有，偶尔也会有一两只源石虫跑进田里偷吃啤酒花，但也是看见人就跑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还从来没有过这么大，还敢袭击人类的源石虫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么说来，村子周围一直都是有源石虫栖息的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "村外那片山林地势复杂，就连我也不清楚里面到底有些什么东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还请问，村子近期有什么特殊的变化吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "变化？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的意思是，村子里最近有来过奇怪的人吗？或者是，有没有突然的气候变化？请您仔细回忆一下，这些情报都很重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非要说的话，三个月前，村里唯一的啤酒加工厂倒闭啦。有些人就是送啤酒花去其他城镇的时候被源石虫袭击的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有头绪吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（摇头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "村长先生，可以请您再带我们去其他源石虫出现过的地方看看吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，跟我来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，那边的人是在干什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_county_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "地上这么多源石虫尸体是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都住手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_004",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸爸——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "村长，你来得正好，我们可是发现罪魁祸首了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "围观的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难怪我们到处都抓不到，原来源石虫都藏在这个人家里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "围观的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太可怕了，居然有人在村子里养这种东西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是你们把这些源石虫都杀了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "村长，大家都看见了，您可得好好处理这个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老实的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老实的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的源石虫都被你们杀光了，你们还想怎样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还想怎样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多少人被你的虫子咬伤了，说不定还会变成感染者。还有大家那么多庄稼——我们决不允许你继续待在这，你们全家都得滚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们这种人就该死在外面！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "围观的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对！滚出垒石村！都该死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老实的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是我的源石虫干的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是？那你倒是说说你养这些源石虫做什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老实的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我凭什么要告诉你？难不成你那啤酒厂倒闭也是我的源石虫害的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我*卡西米尔粗口*——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "住手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "解释一下吧，这些源石虫到底是怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老实的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......用来酿酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老实的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也是无意间发现的，源石虫吃了啤酒花，会产出一种特殊的液体，加入啤酒可以让啤酒的味道变好许多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老实的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前我也对别人提起过，想要推广这种方法，但大家都说我疯了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好家伙，原来还能这样，那我可得尝尝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "的确，记得之前在老家的时候，路过的商队也说过类似的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你们两个又是什么人？少多管闲事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这二位是我请来的矿石病方面的专家，是来帮助我们解决事情的。不许对他们无礼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我说老兄，先冷静想想，这个大小的源石虫要怎么才能咬伤人？又得花几年才能啃坏那么一大片种植园？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再说了，之前不也有搜查队在村外发现了变异源石虫吗，为什么还要对邻居家养的宠物动手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我呸——我又没见过那些比人还大的变异虫子。搜查队的人都躺在医院里了，随你们怎么说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁知道这种矿石病虫子是不是也会什么源石技艺，养这种脏东西的人能安什么好心？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石虫不会感染矿石病！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们所说的源石虫，只是身上披着一层含有源石成分的甲壳，它们体内是绝对没有源石结晶的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有许多生物学学者都研究过，虽然原因还不清楚，但是还从来没有人发现过一只在自然环境下感染矿石病的源石虫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被源石虫咬伤而感染矿石病更是几乎不可能的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请不要用这种毫无根据的罪名来诬陷别人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我凭什么相信——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "村长，请再给我们一点时间，我们一定会查出一个结果的。在那之前，可以请您不要为难这位先生吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请允许我们再去村外调查一下。我想，真正破坏田地的那些源石虫应该不会留在村子里的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，请便。只是，村外山林地势实在有些复杂，如果只有你们两人去怕是会迷路......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啊，那就让我和他们一块去。我倒要看看他们说的变异源石虫到底长什么样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，这样也好。时间紧迫，我们赶紧出发吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_forest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，这儿树林实在是太密集了，源石虫的影子都看不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，刚才言之凿凿的，还以为你们有多厉害呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我劝你们也别逞强了，早点回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，在你身后！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噫！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么都没有......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，嘴上这么说，其实是怕得要死，盼着千万别遇到吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "两位都请冷静一点，现在可不是吵架的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实，人们害怕源石虫的同时，源石虫也是很害怕人类的，一般都不会靠近人类居住的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算偶尔碰见人类，通常也会主动逃走，所以聚居的地方不会离村子太近。我们现在才刚出村子，找不到源石虫也是正常的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以对于这次事件，你怎么看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按常理来说，如果一群野生的源石虫忽然表现出攻击性，最有可能的情况是，它们之前的生活环境发生了急剧变化......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对于这种情况，一般只要正确诱导，就可以让暴躁的源石虫群安定下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但想要知道具体发生了什么，还得先找到这片树林里源石虫原本聚居的地方才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是这片树林这么大，我们到底该上哪去找？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......我来看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果那些源石虫经常出入村子的话，说明它们的活动范围已经相当大了。所以认真找找的话应该可以找到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "果然有的！查德先生，你看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是......野生啤酒花？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯！你看，附近的这几株啤酒花分布得很分散，不像是自然生长的样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "根据村长说的，这一带的源石虫应该很喜欢吃啤酒花。源石虫吃下花的果实后，也会把没有消化的种子散布到各处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以长这些啤酒花的地方，就是源石虫活动过的地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然不完全确定，但是可能性很大！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真有你的香草！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "惭......惭愧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_forest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，跟着那个小姑娘可又走了好久了，你们说的变异源石虫到底在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......看那边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少来！我可不会上当第二次——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（搭箭拉弓）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算你——噫！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "查德先生请稍等一下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它对我们似乎没有敌意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（注视）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它注意到我们了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看，它离开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......吓我一跳，那个大小，我还真担心不能一箭解决呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂......你们为什么要放走那只虫子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它又没有攻击我们，自然没必要招惹它吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "开什么玩笑？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们现在不杀了它，它就有可能继续糟蹋我们的庄稼，袭击我们的村民！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那不是我们要找的变异源石虫......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它刚刚注意到了我们，但没有发起袭击。说明它的习性还是和普通源石虫一样，绝不会主动靠近有人的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那也有可能——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我向您保证，我们一定会尽全力解决村子面临的危险。只是这种情况，可不可以放过无辜呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼......你们最好说到做到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢您查德先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事，我相信你的判断。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按你说的方法，我们这不是找到源石虫了？说明你就是源石虫方面的专家嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“专家”也太夸张了，我只是对源石虫稍微熟悉一些......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在瓦伊凡的时候，有很多机会见到这种动物。我总是觉得它们和其他任何动物一样，是很可爱的生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杜宾教官总是批评我在战场上面对源石虫时会犹豫，我也知道这样不对......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可在战场之外，如果有可能的话，我还是希望尽可能地救下它们，毕竟它们也只是无辜的生命......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，不用这么消沉，我觉得你说的对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然我不养源石虫，但小时候也养过别的宠物，这种心情我也可以理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下次有机会，我还挺想去看看你养的大黑的，哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真......真的？非常欢迎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，那边是不是有个山洞......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里......我记得是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cave_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的天啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这......这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "三人靠近了山洞口。\n暗黄色的源石废料填满了半个山洞，上面遍布着密密麻麻的虫卵。\n在山洞更深处，阴影中透出的红光忽明忽暗，似是在规律呼吸一般。可以看到影影绰绰的轮廓，都是骇人的大小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "救......救命——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "闭嘴！千万别乱动，如果惊动它们就真的完蛋了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "香草......现在怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "香草......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们先离开这吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_forest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道各国对于源石废料的处理规定都有所不同，但是这个......不管在哪都肯定是违法了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这位先生，您之前是在村里的啤酒工厂工作过对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您知道工厂倒闭后把所有的源石废料都扔在山里吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是我......不是我干的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不对......是老板让我们这么做的，我也不知道会变成这样——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你们还愣着干什么？快杀了这些虫子啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么你可以这样理所当然！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它们原本只是生活在这里，是你们毁了它们的家。可到头来还要别人因为你们犯的错去杀了它们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "香草，冷静些......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "简直莫名其妙......这不过是几只虫子——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仅仅是源石虫吗......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是你们害得这些动物变异，现在却可以眼睛都不眨一下地说杀掉它们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不了解真相的时候，就随意迫害身边的人，说什么“该死”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "判断别的生命不该存在就是件这么容易的事吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "香草，冷静一点！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "如果不是被查德拉住，香草不会意识到她将手中的斧枪握得有多紧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......对不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之后再和这个人讨说法——现在我们该怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已经......没有办法了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_county_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对不起，我们还是来晚了，没能......没能救下您养的源石虫......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老实的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别这么说，你们帮我摆脱了罪名，我已经很感激了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那位先生想让我们替他转达，之前的事，他很抱歉......他以后不会再找您麻烦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，还真想尝尝你那独家秘方做的啤酒呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老实的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈，看来是没机会啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老实的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "误会解开了就算了......不过就算这件事解决了，大家对于源石虫应该还是会有心理阴影的吧，我也不好给大家添麻烦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老实的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我相信，肯定还有别人发现了这个“秘方”的。说不定哪天你还会遇到用源石虫酿酒的人，到时候可一定别错过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，这我可得好好记着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_004",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐，外面真的有变异的源石虫吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......放心吧。它们已经去了别的地方，以后再也不会有源石虫来侵扰村子了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_004",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的吗？之前大家都说村子外面有怪物的时候，我真的很害怕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用害怕......应该说，其实它们也很害怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它们并不是怪物。它们也和我们一样，只是想在这片大地上努力活下去的生物......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_004",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......对了姐姐，给你这个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_004",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些人冲进来的时候，我藏下了一只源石虫......也只来得及藏下一只。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_004",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看起来我也不能收养它了，可以拜托姐姐收养它吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一定会照顾好他的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cave_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "炸弹已经安装好了，只要在这里引爆就可以了。当量足够把整个山洞炸塌的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但......香草，你确定没有别的办法了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很显然，之前袭击村庄的就是这些源石虫......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它们在这种源石环境下生活了太久，体内都发生了变异。不只是体形急剧变大，也变得非常有攻击性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "具体原因还不明确，但也没有时间仔细研究了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不管的话，它们迟早会毁掉周围的所有村庄的......我们必须要这么做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "查德先生，请把起爆器给我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员查德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实你没必要——好吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对不起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......保温箱、饲料、水......都和大黑一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是你的新家啦，欢迎回家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇，又一只。真不愧是你小香草，出一次外勤就能捡回来一只宠物......凯尔希医生真的允许你养这么多动物吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然呀，和大黑小刺一样，他也做过登记手续了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感觉你这都要变成源石虫博物馆了啊......那新来的这只，叫什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看起来比大黑还要圆一点呢，就叫你圆圆吧！大黑小刺，要和圆圆好好相处哦，绝对不可以欺负他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "香草，你怎么哭了......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，有吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我没事......呜......芙兰卡前辈......我，我这次没有逃避......我做到了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "speakerId": "char_240_Vanilla",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜......呜呜......呜哇啊啊啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
